; Block pattern: grey stone wall, variant (tiles $07,$08,$0A,$0D)
;
; Defines the current block (op $88) as a 2x2 pattern of grey cobbled stone: the same as #R$7358 but for the
; bottom-right tile. Called by rooms 2, 7.
@label=BlockStoneB
b$7360 DEFB $88,$02,$02,$07,$08,$0A,$0D ; BLOCK 2x2: $07 $08 $0A $0D
 $7367 DEFB $80             ; END
